<title>HONG KONG: Aeon Credit interim net surges 55.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Aeon Credit interim net surges 55.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended August 20</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.26  vs 8.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    34.21  vs 22.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     153.27 vs 111.66</p>
<p>    Company name		 Aeon Credit Service (Asia) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 8-14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Aeon Credit Service, a unit of Aeon Credit Service Co of Japan, is a consumer credit services provider and credit card issuer.</p>
